From b4d792c0fc3866629b253ace728571314d9c7ec3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 15:47:02 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] media: apple: add the VXD stateless H.264 decoder
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

V4L2 stateless H.264 decoding on the A9 VXD (PowerVR MSVDX) core.
The DEVA firmware is not included; it is loaded from
/lib/firmware/apple/vxd-deva.bin, and only when booted through
apple_vxd.boot_firmware=1 or debugfs. The CAVLC table is generated
from the GPL-2.0 Imagination Technologies/Texas Instruments source
in upstream/h264_vlc.h, with its notices kept.

From the release 2 kernel of the iPad 5 port
(https://github.com/brkosebay/omarchy-ipad5), filtered for OrchardLinux.

Signed-off-by: Berkay Kösebay <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
